---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Net Intellect collects, uses and protects personal information."
>
  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated November 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose" style="max-width:72ch;">
      <p>
        Net Intellect Pty Ltd ("Net Intellect", "we", "us") is an IT services provider based in
        Albury, NSW. We handle personal information in line with the <em>Privacy Act 1988</em> (Cth)
        and the Australian Privacy Principles. This policy explains what we collect, why, and how
        you can reach us about it.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>When you contact us or fill in a form</strong>: your name, business name, email
          address, phone number and anything you choose to tell us in your message.</li>
        <li><strong>When you become a client</strong>: contact details for your staff, and the
          account and system information we need to support your IT. We may come across other
          personal information held in your systems while we work on them; we access it only as
          needed to do that work.</li>
        <li><strong>When you visit this website</strong>: our web host keeps standard server logs
          (IP address, browser type, pages requested and the time of the request) for security and
          troubleshooting. This website doesn't use advertising or tracking cookies.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        To answer your enquiry, prepare quotes, deliver and support the services you've asked for,
        bill for them, keep our systems secure, and meet our legal obligations. We'll only send you
        marketing if you've agreed to it, and you can opt out at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>
        We don't sell personal information. We share it only with the service providers who help us
        run the business and deliver your services, such as Microsoft (email and forms), our service
        management and accounting systems, and the vendors whose products we manage for you, and
        only as far as they need it. Some of these providers may store information outside
        Australia. We may also disclose information where the law requires it.
      </p>

      <h2>How we protect it</h2>
      <p>
        We protect personal information with the same controls we use for our clients, including
        multi-factor authentication, access restricted to the staff who need it, and monitored,
        backed-up systems. We keep information only as long as we need it for the purposes above or
        as the law requires, and then delete or de-identify it.
      </p>

      <h2>Data breaches</h2>
      <p>
        If a data breach involving your personal information is likely to cause you serious harm,
        we'll notify you and the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner under the
        Notifiable Data Breaches scheme.
      </p>

      <h2>Access, correction and complaints</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask to see or correct the personal information we hold about you, or raise a privacy
        concern, by contacting us using the details below. We'll respond within 30 days. If you're not
        satisfied with our response, you can contact the
        <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Office of the Australian Information Commissioner</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Net Intellect, 599 Nurigong Street, South Albury NSW 2640<br>
        <a href="tel:+61260510999">(02) 6051 0999</a> ·
        <a href="mailto:info@netintellect.com.au">info@netintellect.com.au</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose h2 { font-size: 20px; margin: 32px 0 10px; }
  .prose p, .prose li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .prose ul { padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
</style>
